## Review inventory and current caveat

The written fixed-20 admission review is a performance interpretation, not a source-only review. The written `v3-combination-source-review.md` is a read-only scoped source review of the earlier 10-file V3 diff; it does not review the current HELD variant. Root brief history records a clean High source review of the additive profile-output change, but no formal written artifact for that review was supplied here. High completed the named other-Wasm classification review, preserved at `current-cost-review.md` (SHA-256 `c525ea4748f76a321718047f47ee9d30c2a74a33517773c9ce57b4af182bdead`). It confirms the JavaScript/setter subtotal is not a compact-descriptor upper envelope because `other-wasm` includes parsing, entry, validation, commit, and semantic algorithms. The profile pair still supplies no fixed-work savings estimate. See `inventory.md` for exact paths and hashes.
